# Residential / mobile proxy for Jungle Scout DataDome.
# Contabo datacenter IP alone will infinite-loop "Verification Required".
#
# Put ONE line in proxy.txt (same folder as the binary), OR set the same
# string on ToolsMandi ctrl → website (or account) → Proxy field.
#
# Formats:
#   socks5://user:pass@host:port
#   http://user:pass@host:port
#   host:port:user:pass
#   host:port
#
# Example:
# socks5://user:pass@1.2.3.4:1080
